        "The model is required. In the pinned isolated form, a write inside the clone succeeded; a file-tool write and a literal shell redirect (`printf X > <path>`) outside the clone were refused by path verification, which is not a sandbox; `git push` was refused. Other outside-write forms are unmeasured.";

    internal const string OpencodeBuilderEnforcement =
        "The model is required. A shell write outside the clone was not refused by the earlier, weaker builder invocation (no isolation), and it is unmeasured for this pinned form. A write inside the clone and a commit succeeded. `git push` was refused, directly and through a `task` subagent, while the clone's `opencode.json` and `.opencode` agent allowed it and a hostile global directory was set in the environment. No global or project plugin or MCP server ran. Writes outside the clone were not probed in this form. That probe ran without the two empty variables, whose effect was measured on the reviewer form.";

